      "text": [
        "One barber. One chair. St John Street, Manchester.",
        "A barber studio built around one appointment at a time.",
        "No queue, no other chairs, no rush. Chair and Blade is a private studio where you get the whole hour, undivided — every cut, fade and shave done by the same pair of hands.",
        "barber, one client in the studio at a time",
        "Private studio, not a shopfront chair row",
        "Appointments only — no walk-in queue",
        "15 years behind the blade",
        "Tucked just off Deansgate on St John Street"
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 884,
      "height": 736,
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "Why there's only one chair",
      "cards": 0,
