      "text": [
        "Services & prices",
        "Every appointment is one-to-one",
        "Prices include a consultation, wash, and finish. Appointments run 30–60 minutes depending on the service, with no one else in the studio at the same time.",
        "Classic Cut",
        "Scissor or clipper cut, tailored to how your hair grows and how you wear it.",
        "Skin Fade",
        "Close skin fade blended into length on top, finished with a straight-razor edge-up.",
        "Cut & Beard",
        "Full haircut plus beard shape, trim and hot towel finish in one appointment.",
        "Beard Trim & Line-up",
        "Shape and tidy with hot towel and balm, no haircut included.",
        "Hot Towel Shave",
        "Traditional open-razor shave with pre-shave oil, hot towels and aftercare balm.",
        "Cut & Colour Consult",
        "Grey blending or full colour, with a consultation the same day.",
        "Cash, card and bank transfer all accepted. 24 hours' notice is appreciated for cancellations, since it's just the one chair."
      ]
    },
