        "No app, no online calendar — just a message",
        "Get in touch",
        "Message on WhatsApp, call, or email with what you're after and a rough day that suits.",
        "Get a time",
        "Danny replies with the next slot that fits — usually within a day or two, sooner for regulars.",
        "Come in",
        "Buzz in at the studio door on St John Street. The chair's free, the kettle's on, and it's just the two of you."
      ]
